Run main.py to replicate all the results together

Run src/d00_preprocessing/gathering.py and src/d00_preprocessing/matching.py before running the below codes to replicate results separately
Run src/d01_figures/daily.py to replicate daily figures
Run src/d01_figures/intraday.py to replicate intraday figures
Run src/d02_results/daily.R to replicate daily-level results
Run src/d02_results/intraday.R to replicate intraday-level results
Run src/d02_results/russiaukraine.R to replicate results for the Russian and Ukrainen firms
Run src/d02_results/aerospacedefense.R to replicate results for the Aerospace and Defense firms


